<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 50 bln levs 4-wk T-bills next week.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 50 bln levs 4-wk T-bills next week.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer five issues of four-week discount T-bills worth a total of 50 billion levs at daily auctions next week, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The issues will be offered with a maximum par of 10 billion levs each and no minimum acceptable price set in advance, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER     AUCTION DATE    ISSUE DATE    MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3039997005	 June 23	   June 24	 July 22</p>
<p> BG3040197009	 June 24	   June 25	 July 23</p>
<p> BG3040297007	 June 25	   June 26	 July 24</p>
<p> BG3040397005	 June 26	   June 27	 July 25</p>
<p> BG3040497003	 June 27	   June 30	 July 28</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
